paseo-lite licensing
====================

This repository contains two layers of work, under different terms.

1. Modifications and original work: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0
   (SPDX: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0)

   Required Notice: Copyright (c) 2025-present Sudono Tanjung (https://github.com/sudtanj)

   All modifications and original code in this repository authored by
   Sudono Tanjung, from the commit that introduced this file onward, are
   source-available under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, the full
   text of which is in LICENSE-POLYFORM-NONCOMMERCIAL.md.

   In plain words:
     - FREE for personal use: running it for yourself, studying it,
       hobby projects, research, education and experimentation.
       Noncommercial organisations (charities, schools, public research
       bodies) are covered too, as the license defines.
     - NOT free for commercial use. Using it in or for a business,
       offering it as a (hosted) service, bundling it into a commercial
       product, or using it to make money in any way needs a paid
       commercial license from the copyright holder.
     - Redistribution must keep this notice and the license text.

   COMMERCIAL LICENSES: contact the copyright holder via
   https://github.com/sudtanj (GitHub profile / sponsors page).

